Z||000006||turbo86se||03-04-2000||10:00 AM||||Nice looking Fiero! Love the gold paint! It may take me a while to dig up, but one of the OLD Car Audio & Electronics magazines I have has a pic of a black GT, with sweet black wheels. What this guy did was remove the front turn signals under the headlights and installing driving lights there. Looked pretty good!||||reg||10
